{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47393","headline":"题福唐观二首 一 · 杜光庭","name":"题福唐观二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"盘空蹑翠到山巅，竹殿云楼势逼天。\n古洞草深微有路，旧碑文灭不知年。\n八州物象通檐外，万里烟霞在目前。\n自是人间轻举地，何须蓬岛访真仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47393.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47393","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}